    {
      "id": "claim_30ae67a88ad34a308529f97f05b4b0a3",
      "statement": "The tools/router-webui/womo_router.html standalone dashboard talks directly to the RUTX11's /ubus endpoint from the browser using the same JSON-RPC 2.0 session-login pattern as the Display firmware (login, cached session token ~4:30min, auto re-login on permission error), auto-refreshing every 15s, and likewise has no AP disable switch.",
